Z||000000||DecadenceR||06-19-2001||12:00 PM||||I make a really big deal about it when i see another fiero in my area because there are like none of them. Like ast night when I saw a gold one parked next to mine as I came out of the bar, i was all likr Woo-hoo!!!<P>Anyway, saturday night I was headed to the Point Pleasant beach to go to the bars. I was in a friends car, and while driving down 35, someone says "Look, it's your car!" I look over and shure enough, there's a white 86+ coupe next to me (definitely 4 cyl, looked like an auto). I started laughing my ass off. Everyone asked me what was so funny, and I just told them they wouldn't understand. These are the stickers it had....<P>Momo<BR>MSD<BR>Accel<BR>Hooker<BR>Pacesetter<BR>HKS<BR>Borla<BR>Nitto<BR>Pirelli<P>Now, I forgot to mention....<BR>The rims were stock, the tires were goodyear, and there was no visible exhaust change. Plus, there was one headlight up...<BR>Oh, and I forgot the "Pontiac Racing" sticker on the side as well....<BR>I was laughing hysterically, as well as almost crying out of sadness...||||reg||1
