Z||000010||DecadenceR||06-19-2001||08:42 PM||||I'm not saying that the guy didn'thave some of this stuff. But yes, you can tell if a car is stick or not when you're driving next to it at the same speed and you notice the inside of the passenegr compartment. As i said the car had stock rims, Goodyear tires, the exhaust seemed to be stock, interior seemed to be orignnal stock, including warping at the center console (noticed this at the light).<BR>I'm not saying your car isn't fast. I also didn't seem to emntion whether this car was fast or not anywhere. What I was talking about is the stickers on the car that the person seemingly put there just to have stickers.<BR>Personally, I don't drive my car professionally or for money. It's a daily driver. So I wouldn't put any of these stickers on my car. <BR>If you got it, flaunt it. But if you don't....||||reg||1
